--         ∀ l : ZMod (s i), ‖IntMul.HvdH.P47.toC (B0seg p (Pf (s i)) R lam w (s i) (t i) α W l.val) -
--           2 ^ p * Bm i (fun k => IntMul.HvdH.P47.toC (W k.val) / 2 ^ p) l‖ ≤ 9)
--       (hZ : ∀ i, B0seg p (Pf (s i)) R lam w (s i) (t i) α (fun _ => (0, 0)) = fun _ => (0, 0)) :
--       RepPad p s t (tensorGo (mapsBs p R lam w α Pf s t) (List.ofFn t) ys)
--           (vOf p s t (tensorGo (mapsBs p R lam w α Pf s t) (List.ofFn t) ys)) ∧
--         DiscL p (tensorGo (mapsBs p R lam w α Pf s t) (List.ofFn t) ys) ∧
--         ‖vOf p s t (tensorGo (mapsBs p R lam w α Pf s t) (List.ofFn t) ys) - tensCLM (kerB Bm) y‖ ≤
--           (9 * d) * hp p
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Segmented inverse (S2), machine side 11: the `B₀` tensor pass
--
--   Axis by axis (`tensorGo`, as the frozen `KFY.passB`), every `t_i`-line `X` is replaced by the
--   `t_i` values `B0seg … (X as a function) l` (zero for `l ≥ s_i`): this is what `lineB` computes
--   (`lineB_list`, with `n_c λ = t_i`).
--
--   **`passBseg`**: for per-axis maps `Bm i` with `‖Bm i‖ ≤ 1/2`, the per-axis bound `9` of
--   `r6_axisMaps_fit` and `B0seg 0 = 0`, from `RepFull ys y`, `‖y‖ ≤ 1`:
--   `RepPad` of the result, every entry in the disc (`GB (p+2)`), and
--   `‖vOf − tensCLM (kerB Bm) y‖ ≤ 9 d · 2^{-p}`.
--
